Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always chosen to use my intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep a lid on my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I could do that because thought is free,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,even if the body is in chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea has always let emotions take control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire has fed on hatred, and earth has followed convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
